{
 "comment": "The orchestrator's boundaries: each host's API (hostClient, which *host.Client is), the Kubernetes API (pods) and the bucket's control records (records). The fakes in cmd/sproutfs-orchestrator/orchestrator_test.go fail each request at random: a request that never reached the far side, one it refused, and one it carried out whose answer was lost, which for a request that changes nothing is the first. A host is also cut off the pod network for minutes, half the times it loses an answer, and the campaign restarts the orchestrator in the middle of a migration. See scripts/check-faults.py.",
